From 5bef92cde28106cff6e5fa43206164811dd956b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:58:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] test-posix: Check semget, semctl and semop

Initialization of new sets, every semctl command and semid_ds
member, semadj cleared by SETVAL and SETALL, ordered all-or-nothing
arrays, waits counted in semncnt and semzcnt and ended by a change,
a signal or removal, SEM_UNDO, and the errors.
